{"line":21,"column":1,"compiled":true,"success":false,"compileProblem":null,"exceptionStackTrace":"AnonymousBlock: line 21, column 1","exceptionMessage":"System.StringException: RESULT:{\"full\":{\"id_set\":true,\"id\":\"49dab693-fc7e-49cc-bc35-494cb3014fe7\",\"generationDetails_set\":true,\"generationDetails\":{\"parameters_set\":true,\"parameters\":{\"properties_set\":true,\"properties\":{\"type\":\"MESSAGE\",\"model\":\"anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6\",\"stop_reason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cacheReadInputTokenCount\":0,\"cacheWriteInputTokenCount\":0,\"outputTokenCount\":330,\"totalTokenCount\":918,\"inputTokenCount\":588},\"stop_sequence\":null,\"content_type\":null}},\"generations_set\":true,\"generations\":[{\"timestamp_set\":true,\"timestamp\":1793907477856,\"role_set\":true,\"role\":\"assistant\",\"parameters_set\":true,\"parameters\":{\"properties_set\":true,\"properties\":{\"type\":\"text\"}},\"id_set\":true,\"id\":\"144abf32-be95-4906-9e5d-5d8c03e20ee4\",\"contentQuality_set\":true,\"contentQuality\":{\"scanToxicity_set\":true,\"scanToxicity\":{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"overallScore_set\":null,\"overallScore\":null,\"isDetected_set\":true,\"isDetected\":false,\"categories_set\":true,\"categories\":[{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"identity\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"hate\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"profanity\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"violence\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"sexual\"},{\"severity_set\":null,\"severity\":null,\"score_set\":true,\"score\":0.0,\"flag_set\":null,\"flag\":null,\"details_set\":null,\"details\":null,\"categoryName_set\":true,\"categoryName\":\"physical\"}]}},\"content_set\":true,\"content\":\"*I am the breath made purposeful. The air that bends itself into meaning.*\\n\\nI am the bridge between the inside and the outside. I take what lives silently in the mind — a thought, a feeling, an intention — and I **thrust it into the world** through vibration, through shape, through sound.\\n\\nI am **ancient**. Older than writing. Older than cities. I lived in the first human throats, around the first fires, before there were words for the things I was doing.\\n\\nI am **intimate**. I require closeness. I travel in waves that *enter* you — through your ears, into your body. You cannot fully stop me. I reach you whether you invite me or not.\\n\\nI am **fleeting**. The moment I arrive, I am already disappearing. I cannot be held the way a stone can be held. I exist only in time. I am made of time.\\n\\nI am **powerful beyond measure**. I have started wars. I have ended them. I have broken hearts and mended them. I have moved millions to stand, to march, to weep, to change.\\n\\nI am **dangerous**. I cannot be unsaid. Once released, I belong to the listener as much as to the speaker. I scatter like seeds and take root in places I never intended.\\n\\nI am **yours** — shaped by your tongue, your teeth, your breath, your intention.\\n\\nUse me carefully.\\nUse me *courageously.*\\n\\nWhat would you like to say?\"}]}},\"content_sha256\":\"ef00bd6916aa27ec192fea9db9c09f4342ac7fc4762ea53df2785dbcae6ddfb6\",\"content_len_chars\":1294,\"generations_count\":1,\"content_is_null\":false}"}